Alembic environment for the modular monolith.

Revisions are NOT stored here: each module keeps its own history under
    modules/<module>/src/infrastructure/database/migrations

Create a revision for a module (first revision of a branch also needs
--branch-label):

    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "create shipments table" \
        --version-path modules/shipment/src/infrastructure/database/migrations \
        --branch-label shipment

    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "create clearance cases table" \
        --version-path modules/customs_clearance/src/infrastructure/database/migrations \
        --branch-label customs_clearance

Apply everything:      alembic upgrade heads
Inspect the history:   alembic history --verbose
